WEBVTT

00:00:03.347 --> 00:00:05.884
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Vienna, tell us about your plan.

00:00:06.555 --> 00:00:09.245
Why are you going to walk from Venice to China?

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:16.170
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> It’s an amazing adventure!

00:00:16.364 --> 00:00:22.389
I’m going to do the same journey that the famous Venetian traveler Marco Polo did.

00:00:22.828 --> 00:00:24.915
It’s called the Silk Road.

00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:33.086
But you know, Marco Polo started it when he was only 17, and I’m starting it at 72!

00:00:34.012 --> 00:00:35.749
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> When are you going to leave home?

00:00:36.228 --> 00:00:39.195
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m going to start the journey next week.

00:00:39.761 --> 00:00:47.743
First, I’m going to walk to Slovenia. Then from Slovenia to Croatia, and then Bulgaria.

00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:50.912
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How many countries are you going to go through?

00:00:51.425 --> 00:00:55.860
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Thirteen – that’s not counting Italy and China.

00:00:56.353 --> 00:01:01.653
Some very exciting places, like Kazakhstan, Mongolia…

00:01:01.953 --> 00:01:04.940
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Ooh. And how long is it going to take?

00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:09.379
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> A long time! Probably three years.

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:12.183
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Wow! Are you nervous?

00:01:12.889 --> 00:01:15.344
Do you think the journey is going to be dangerous?

00:01:15.897 --> 00:01:19.814
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m a little nervous, but I’m ready for the challenge.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:25.066
And I have an app on my phone so that my doctor can check my health.

00:01:25.914 --> 00:01:27.898
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are you going to take a lot of photos?

00:01:28.191 --> 00:01:33.217
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Yes, I am. I also want to make videos of my journey,

00:01:33.241 --> 00:01:36.162
so I’m going to use a GoPro camera.

00:01:37.143 --> 00:01:40.400
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What’s going to be the most difficult thing about the journey?

00:01:41.012 --> 00:01:42.691
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Probably the weather!

00:01:42.998 --> 00:01:46.075
It’s going to be very cold in Mongolia.

00:01:46.615 --> 00:01:49.110
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Um... Where are you going to stay?

00:01:49.636 --> 00:01:52.158
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> I’m not going to stay in hotels.

00:01:52.617 --> 00:01:56.601
I want to stay with local people I meet along the way,

00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:59.338
so I can listen to their different stories.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.617
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Well, good luck, Vienna

00:02:02.063 --> 00:02:05.820
– I’m going to follow your journey on social media to see how it’s going.

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.826
<v><b>Vienna:</b></v> Thank you very much.